{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0194_1000_p", "source_sha256": "0161d58699b0db9395256f9b2d96dc9cb9916755c1946dbe69cd5fe827dee056", "ja": "（今日はドラマのリハーサル。伊織は幼馴染のひなたと\n敵同士になってしまった、海賊団の団長役だが……）", "zh": "（今天是戏剧的彩排。伊织饰演的是与青梅竹马日向成为敌人的海盗团团长，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0194_1001_007ior", "source_sha256": "f24dbd9a292c6a62337478b1e1ac41e4b5a06805a09038be285781ca6f2c7e5b", "ja": "おまたせ、{$P$}。\nそろそろ始まるわよね？　こっちは準備できたわよ。", "zh": "让你久等了，{$P$}。\n差不多要开始了吧？我这边已经准备好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0194_1002_p", "source_sha256": "4e5f394d9f4121574e8e82e3dabef9a40e3fddcd8342873ab2ecfa3055989f7d", "ja": "お疲れさま。それが、もう少し待つらしいんだ。\n悪いけど、みんなにもそう伝えてもらっていいかな。", "zh": "辛苦了。那个，好像还要再等一会儿。不好意思，可以也帮我把这件事转告给大家吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0194_1003_007ior", "source_sha256": "2b6ee53194d9e0edb1fbd49de17dc97eb4028255da9435995379019e53c2cf9b", "ja": "ええ。……でも、なるべく急いだほうがいいわね。\nウチの連中は、気が早い子が多いんだから。", "zh": "嗯……不过，还是尽量快一点比较好呢。我们这边性子急的人可不少。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0194_1004_007ior", "source_sha256": "4ebbeb29f945a678a33c7135e9e6c3ec0bba2d1bfe8b48fab91f238998783dd6", "ja": "みんな、もうすぐだって盛り上がっちゃってるの。\nこのままじゃ歌って踊りだしちゃうかもしれないわよ♪", "zh": "大家都因为马上要开始了而情绪高涨呢。\n照这样下去，说不定会直接又唱又跳起来哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0194_1005_p", "source_sha256": "757f0b7f985d5a0c2f03d787018969dff9a619f062f6b9ffa20d7216537dccea", "ja": "おっと、それはまずいな。\nそこは親分の統率力でひとつ。頼むよ、親分！", "zh": "哎呀，那可不妙啊。这就靠老大的统率力了。拜托你了，老大！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0194_1006_007ior", "source_sha256": "29d991cbef7bbb031adb6ceba8716c08c6773905ffa705c50f6366ce9ba72bc1", "ja": "ちょっと！　アンタまで私を親分って呼ぶのは\nやめてよね。なんかほかの呼び方はないの？", "zh": "等一下！你也别叫我“大姐头”了。就不能换个称呼吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0194_1007_p", "source_sha256": "3ce37a5ee26513ce8ac913b765791d553ed59305a5430ea1cd34004483339e6a", "ja": "アンタまで？　……おっと、失礼、「キャプテン」。\nこれでいいかな？", "zh": "连你也？……哎呀，失礼了，“队长”。这样可以了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0194_1008_007ior", "source_sha256": "db3a2efc1547b135858e79be550135329d2baafd5b57351cb107827735632509", "ja": "よろしい。はぁ、まったく……。実は、亜美も美奈子も\n親分親分って、ちっともまともに呼ばないのよ。", "zh": "很好。哈啊，真是的……其实，亚美和美奈子也是，\n张口闭口都是“老大老大”的，根本不好好叫我呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0194_1009_007ior", "source_sha256": "058234cbb4c667dd75741d4ad70295ca51008ac049a1e261b789bb68d66e50b9", "ja": "やよいは何度言っても伊織ちゃんだし、瑞希なんて\nなにを間違えたのかお母さん、なんて呼んだんだから。", "zh": "弥生无论怎么提醒都还是叫我伊织，瑞希更离谱，\n不知道搞错了什么，居然叫我妈妈呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0194_1010_p", "source_sha256": "572c6d81821006ab6a28b14fa8940aec748f323716b5de80f0ac12d21266f19c", "ja": "はは、それだけ慕われているってことだよ。みんな\n伊織が海賊団の団長って事は認めてるわけだし。", "zh": "哈哈，这就说明她们很仰慕你嘛。大家都承认伊织是海盗团团长这一点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0194_1011_007ior", "source_sha256": "c6e0bcaa0b760531f65b35e80ba51d568fa3d35ab65d201d61a309b954fc6927", "ja": "それもまだ納得してないのよね。はぁ……。\nねぇ、アンタから見て、私ってそんなに海賊っぽい？", "zh": "那件事我也还没法接受呢。唉……\n喂，在你看来，我真的那么像海盗吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0194_1012_p", "source_sha256": "58ec700b351a4d79e82b3e4c62d077d4334f7eb38205cb00f7cb4b4cc7d253b3", "ja": "海賊っぽいと言うよりは、団長……キャプテンでは\nあるかもな。伊織は何をやっても伊織だからさ。", "zh": "与其说像海盗，不如说……你或许更像团长……船长吧。因为不管做什么，伊织就是伊织。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0194_1013_007ior", "source_sha256": "ad2740870f84854bda460a2dc5e6114e1a71fae6695c2dae0e676b90fef63409", "ja": "どういう意味よ。", "zh": "什么意思嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0194_1014_p", "source_sha256": "3034dd8a14d8b888da8019d2827e4700908c5cd98d84e13aa7a256567dd7a7b7", "ja": "なんとなく、伊織なら……航路の先に嵐がきたとしても\n自分のやり方で進んでいけちゃう気がするんだよな。", "zh": "总觉得，如果是伊织的话……就算航路前方出现暴风雨，也能用自己的方式继续前进。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0194_1015_p", "source_sha256": "ec84d83ba4280f4511d6662171c8faaed8c4379289be7df16be92e78d642fccc", "ja": "上手く言えないけど、そういう安心感があるから\nみんな、伊織についていきたくなるんじゃないかな。", "zh": "虽然不太好说，但正因为有这种安心感，大家才会想跟随伊织吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0194_1016_007ior", "source_sha256": "c1a71b5e716f40707c8a2c72a208be25e1ab116ddf00a56047c379c47592c107", "ja": "ふうん……みんな、ね。\n……{$P$}もそうなの？", "zh": "嗯……大家啊。\n……{$P$}也一样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0194_1017_p", "source_sha256": "4fa9653cd88304d81f43aad68b18b99291860661c0a851112b14130f7613c1c2", "ja": "もちろん。伊織がキャプテンの船なら、\nどんなに荒れた海だって恐れず漕ぎ出していけるよ。", "zh": "当然。伊织当船长的船，就算面对再大的风浪，也能毫不畏惧地扬帆出航。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0194_1018_007ior", "source_sha256": "44c3226bec5b1c3d4d81833a860822eb3f05e3befd6280910f3dddebaf1a71d4", "ja": "ふ、ふん、また調子のいいこと言って！\nまぁ、当然と言えば当然のことだけど。", "zh": "哼、哼，又说些顺着我好听的话！  \n不过，真要说起来，这也是理所当然的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0194_1019_p", "source_sha256": "4f9dcb3343691cd4a29f3a6898e235fa647b185df78d2c6345d54188be1cac9d", "ja": "……ん？　伊織、気のせいかも\nしれないけど、少し、顔が赤……。", "zh": "……嗯？伊织，虽然可能是我多心了，\n但你的脸是不是有点红……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0194_1020_007ior", "source_sha256": "047129848beb814397e7072db66680e0884196b1a66fa55665d1e5dbdae35235", "ja": "な、なんでもないわよ！　それより、おしゃべりは\nこのくらいにして、みんなのところに戻らないと。", "zh": "没、没什么啦！比起这个，闲聊就到此为止，我们得回大家那边去了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0194_1021_007ior", "source_sha256": "c9dad61889511ced08c943d93c9bc68f88fb113c0dba0da1c4302e6534c0d9cd", "ja": "忠実なウチの団員たちに、早くキャプテンの\nかっこいいところを見せてあげないとね！　にひひっ♪", "zh": "必须早点让我那些忠诚的团员们看看，\n队长帅气的一面才行呢！嘻嘻♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
